dashboard.definition:
{
	"title": "User Experience",
	"description": "Client health, wireless, ThousandEyes, bandwidth performance",
	"inputs": {
		"input_global_trp": {
			"options": {
				"defaultValue": "-4h@m,now",
				"token": "global_time"
			},
			"title": "",
			"type": "input.timerange"
		}
	},
	"defaults": {
		"dataSources": {
			"ds.search": {
				"options": {
					"queryParameters": {
						"earliest": "$global_time.earliest$",
						"latest": "$global_time.latest$"
					}
				}
			},
			"ds.spl2": {
				"options": {
					"queryParameters": {
						"earliest": "$global_time.earliest$",
						"latest": "$global_time.latest$"
					}
				}
			}
		},
		"tokens": {
			"default": {}
		}
	},
	"visualizations": {
		"viz_about_bg": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)"
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_about_purpose": {
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"fontColor": "#2B2B2B",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "# User Experience\n\nReal-time view of **end-user connectivity health** across wireless, wired, and internet paths. Use this dashboard to confirm client experience is healthy, identify degradation sources, and correlate internal network health with external path performance.\n\n**Audience:** Network Operations, Service Desk, IT Leadership\n**Primary Sources:** Cisco Catalyst Center (Client Health), Cisco ThousandEyes (Path Health)\n**Refresh:** All panels follow the global time picker; client health refreshes every 15 minutes\n\n---\n\n## How to Navigate This Dashboard\n\n**Overview** — Client health scores, active client counts, and ThousandEyes internet path scores.\n*Start here — confirm end-user connectivity is healthy across all sites.*\n\n**Details & KPI Reference** — Wireless vs wired health, device types, client OS mix, and ThousandEyes test-level performance.\n*Drill in to identify which device categories or network paths are degrading the user experience.*\n\n> **Reading pattern:** Healthy client scores + green ThousandEyes paths = good UX. Degraded scores = check Details tab for wired/wireless split and ThousandEyes test results."
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_about_sources": {
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"fontColor": "#2B2B2B",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "## Data Sources & Troubleshooting\n\n---\n\n**Cisco Catalyst Center** — Cisco DNA Center App for Splunk\nSourcetypes: `cisco:dnac:clienthealth`\nFreshness: ~15 min\n\n**Cisco ThousandEyes** — Cisco ThousandEyes App for Splunk\nSourcetypes: ThousandEyes OTel stream data\nData Model: `Cisco_ThousandEyes.Test_Metrics`\nFreshness: ~5 min\n\n---\n\n**Panel showing \"No results\"?**\n\n1. **Widen the time range** — client health needs at least 4 hours\n2. **Verify ThousandEyes App is installed** — check *Manage Apps*\n3. **Confirm ThousandEyes data** — run `| tstats count FROM datamodel=\"Cisco_ThousandEyes.Test_Metrics\"`\n4. **Check data model acceleration** — ThousandEyes panels use accelerated data models."
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_box_detail": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)"
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_box_device_os": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)"
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_box_health": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)"
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_box_te": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)"
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_box_trends": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)"
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_box_wireless": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)"
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_client_health_gauge": {
			"context": {
				"majorColorEditorConfig": [
					{
						"to": 70,
						"value": "#D64550"
					},
					{
						"from": 70,
						"to": 85,
						"value": "#E5A823"
					},
					{
						"from": 85,
						"value": "#6EBE4A"
					}
				]
			},
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_client_health_current"
			},
			"description": "Composite score from Catalyst Center — higher is better",
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"majorColor": "> majorValue | rangeValue(majorColorEditorConfig)",
				"majorFontSize": 36,
				"showTrendIndicator": false,
				"sparklineDisplay": "off",
				"unit": "%"
			},
			"title": "Client Health",
			"type": "splunk.singlevalue"
		},
		"viz_client_os_pie": {
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_top_client_os"
			},
			"description": "Top 5 operating systems by unique MAC count",
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"labelDisplay": "valuesAndPercentage",
				"seriesColors": [
					"#6EBE4A",
					"#049FD9",
					"#E5A823",
					"#D64550",
					"#6E6E6E"
				],
				"showDonutHole": true
			},
			"title": "Client OS Distribution",
			"type": "splunk.pie"
		},
		"viz_client_trend": {
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_client_health"
			},
			"description": "Health score distribution over time — stacked by Good / Fair / Poor",
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"legendDisplay": "off",
				"seriesColors": [
					"#6EBE4A",
					"#E5A823",
					"#D64550"
				],
				"stackMode": "stacked100",
				"xAxisLabelVisibility": "hide",
				"xAxisTitleVisibility": "hide"
			},
			"title": "Client Health Trend",
			"type": "splunk.area"
		},
		"viz_clients_donut": {
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_active_clients"
			},
			"description": "Clients split by Wireless / Wired / other",
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"labelDisplay": "valuesAndPercentage",
				"seriesColors": [
					"#049FD9",
					"#6EBE4A",
					"#E5A823"
				],
				"showDonutHole": true
			},
			"title": "Active Clients",
			"type": "splunk.pie"
		},
		"viz_clients_total": {
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_clients_total"
			},
			"description": "Total unique clients seen in the selected time range",
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"majorColor": "#2B2B2B",
				"majorFontSize": 28,
				"showTrendIndicator": false,
				"sparklineDisplay": "off"
			},
			"title": "Total Clients",
			"type": "splunk.singlevalue"
		},
		"viz_dev_types_bar": {
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_top_device_types"
			},
			"description": "By unique MAC count",
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"dataValuesDisplay": "all",
				"legendDisplay": "off",
				"seriesColors": [
					"#6EBE4A"
				],
				"xAxisTitleVisibility": "hide",
				"yAxisTitleVisibility": "hide"
			},
			"title": "Top 5 Device Types",
			"type": "splunk.bar"
		},
		"viz_health_by_type_trend": {
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_client_health_by_type"
			},
			"description": "Wired vs wireless health scores over time",
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"legendDisplay": "off",
				"seriesColors": [
					"#6EBE4A",
					"#049FD9"
				],
				"xAxisLabelVisibility": "hide",
				"xAxisTitleVisibility": "hide",
				"yAxisTitleVisibility": "hide"
			},
			"title": "Client Health by Type",
			"type": "splunk.area"
		},
		"viz_info_details": {
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"fontColor": "#2B2B2B",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "## Metric Reference — Details & KPI Reference Tab\n\n---\n\n**Wireless Health** — Current wireless client health score\n**Wired Health** — Current wired client health score\n**Client Health by Type** — Health trend split by wired vs wireless clients\n**Top 5 Device Types** — Most common connected device types\n**Client OS Distribution** — Connected client operating system breakdown\n\n---\n\n**ThousandEyes — Test Results** — Per-test latency, loss, and jitter\n**ThousandEyes — Test Health** — Test status distribution (healthy / degraded / critical)\n**ThousandEyes — Agent Performance** — Agent-level metrics with latency, loss, jitter, and status"
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_info_overview": {
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"fontColor": "#2B2B2B",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "## Metric Reference — Overview Tab\n\n---\n\n**Client Health** — Composite client health score from Catalyst Center\n**Active Clients** — Total connected client count with type breakdown\n**Total Clients** — Single-value client count\n**Internet Paths (ThousandEyes)** — Composite test health from ThousandEyes agents\n\n---\n\n**ThousandEyes Agent Status** — Agent status table showing health per agent\n**Client Health Trend** — Client score over the selected time range"
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_narr_details": {
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"fontColor": "#6E6E6E",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "Detailed **client and network path analytics** — wireless vs wired health, device types, OS mix, and ThousandEyes test performance. Use this tab to isolate which client categories or paths are degrading experience."
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_narr_overview": {
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"fontColor": "#6E6E6E",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "Real-time view of **end-user connectivity health** across wireless, wired, and internet paths. Use this tab to confirm client experience is healthy and spot degradation before users report issues."
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_p_hdr_bg": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.88)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.06)"
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_p_hdr_title": {
			"options": {
				"fontColor": "#005073",
				"fontSize": "large",
				"markdown": "## User Experience"
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_te_agent_table": {
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_te_agent_perf"
			},
			"description": "Per-agent latency, loss, and jitter",
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"count": 10,
				"fontSize": "small",
				"headerVisibility": "fixed",
				"tableFormat": {
					"rowBackgroundColors": "> table | seriesByIndex(0) | pick(rowBackgroundColorsByIndex)"
				}
			},
			"title": "ThousandEyes — Agent Performance",
			"type": "splunk.table"
		},
		"viz_te_detail_table": {
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_base_te_tests"
			},
			"description": "Per-test latency, loss, and jitter",
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"count": 10,
				"fontSize": "small",
				"headerVisibility": "fixed",
				"tableFormat": {
					"rowBackgroundColors": "> table | seriesByIndex(0) | pick(rowBackgroundColorsByIndex)"
				}
			},
			"title": "ThousandEyes — Test Results",
			"type": "splunk.table"
		},
		"viz_te_gauge": {
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_te_health"
			},
			"description": "Composite score from latency, loss, HTTP availability, and page load",
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"field": "score",
				"majorColor": "#6E6E6E",
				"majorFontSize": 28,
				"showTrendIndicator": false,
				"sparklineDisplay": "off",
				"unit": ""
			},
			"title": "Internet Paths (ThousandEyes)",
			"type": "splunk.singlevalue"
		},
		"viz_te_health_donut": {
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_te_health_summary"
			},
			"description": "Test status distribution",
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"labelDisplay": "valuesAndPercentage",
				"seriesColorsByField": {
					"Critical": "#D64550",
					"Degraded": "#E5A823",
					"Healthy": "#6EBE4A"
				},
				"showDonutHole": true
			},
			"title": "ThousandEyes — Test Health",
			"type": "splunk.pie"
		},
		"viz_te_table": {
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_te_agents"
			},
			"description": "Per-agent latency, loss, jitter, and health status",
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"count": 5,
				"fontSize": "small",
				"headerVisibility": "fixed",
				"tableFormat": {
					"rowBackgroundColors": "> table | seriesByIndex(0) | pick(rowBackgroundColorsByIndex)"
				}
			},
			"title": "ThousandEyes Agent Status",
			"type": "splunk.table"
		},
		"viz_ux_section": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.45)",
				"fillOpacity": 1,
				"rx": 12,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.06)",
				"strokeOpacity": 0.3,
				"strokeWidth": 1
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_ux_section2": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.45)",
				"fillOpacity": 1,
				"rx": 12,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.06)",
				"strokeOpacity": 0.3,
				"strokeWidth": 1
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_wired_gauge": {
			"context": {
				"majorColorEditorConfig": [
					{
						"to": 70,
						"value": "#D64550"
					},
					{
						"from": 70,
						"to": 85,
						"value": "#E5A823"
					},
					{
						"from": 85,
						"value": "#6EBE4A"
					}
				]
			},
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_wired_health"
			},
			"description": "Current wired client health — from Catalyst Center",
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"majorColor": "> majorValue | rangeValue(majorColorEditorConfig)",
				"majorFontSize": 48,
				"showTrendIndicator": false,
				"sparklineDisplay": "off",
				"unit": "%"
			},
			"title": "Wired Health",
			"type": "splunk.singlevalue"
		},
		"viz_wireless_gauge": {
			"context": {
				"majorColorEditorConfig": [
					{
						"to": 70,
						"value": "#D64550"
					},
					{
						"from": 70,
						"to": 85,
						"value": "#E5A823"
					},
					{
						"from": 85,
						"value": "#6EBE4A"
					}
				]
			},
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_wireless_health"
			},
			"description": "Current wireless client health — from Catalyst Center",
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"majorColor": "> majorValue | rangeValue(majorColorEditorConfig)",
				"majorFontSize": 48,
				"showTrendIndicator": false,
				"sparklineDisplay": "off",
				"unit": "%"
			},
			"title": "Wireless Health",
			"type": "splunk.singlevalue"
		}
	},
	"dataSources": {
		"ds_active_clients": {
			"name": "Executive Dashboard - ds_active_clients",
			"options": {
				"app": "splunk-cisco-dashboards",
				"queryParameters": {
					"earliest": "$global_time.earliest$",
					"latest": "$global_time.latest$"
				},
				"ref": "Executive Dashboard - ds_active_clients",
				"useSavedTimeRange": false
			},
			"type": "ds.savedSearch"
		},
		"ds_base_client_ref": {
			"name": "DNAC Client Base",
			"options": {
				"query": "`index_catalyst` sourcetype=\"cisco:dnac:client\"\n| fields macAddress, osType, deviceType",
				"queryParameters": {
					"earliest": "$global_time.earliest$",
					"latest": "$global_time.latest$"
				}
			},
			"type": "ds.search"
		},
		"ds_base_te_tests": {
			"name": "User Experience - ds_te_tests",
			"options": {
				"app": "splunk-cisco-dashboards",
				"queryParameters": {
					"earliest": "$global_time.earliest$",
					"latest": "$global_time.latest$"
				},
				"ref": "User Experience - ds_te_tests",
				"useSavedTimeRange": false
			},
			"type": "ds.savedSearch"
		},
		"ds_client_health": {
			"name": "User Experience - ds_client_health",
			"options": {
				"app": "splunk-cisco-dashboards",
				"queryParameters": {
					"earliest": "$global_time.earliest$",
					"latest": "$global_time.latest$"
				},
				"ref": "User Experience - ds_client_health",
				"useSavedTimeRange": false
			},
			"type": "ds.savedSearch"
		},
		"ds_client_health_by_type": {
			"name": "Client Health by Type",
			"options": {
				"query": "`index_catalyst` sourcetype=\"cisco:dnac:clienthealth\" (clientType=\"WIRELESS\" OR clientType=\"WIRED\") scoreType=\"ALL\" | eval health=if(scoreValue>=0, scoreValue, 0) | timechart avg(eval(round(health, 2))) by clientType",
				"queryParameters": {
					"earliest": "$global_time.earliest$",
					"latest": "$global_time.latest$"
				}
			},
			"type": "ds.search"
		},
		"ds_client_health_current": {
			"name": "Executive Dashboard - ds_client_health_current",
			"options": {
				"app": "splunk-cisco-dashboards",
				"queryParameters": {
					"earliest": "$global_time.earliest$",
					"latest": "$global_time.latest$"
				},
				"ref": "Executive Dashboard - ds_client_health_current",
				"useSavedTimeRange": false
			},
			"type": "ds.savedSearch"
		},
		"ds_clients_total": {
			"name": "Total Clients",
			"options": {
				"extend": "ds_active_clients",
				"query": "| stats sum(count) as total | fields total"
			},
			"type": "ds.chain"
		},
		"ds_te_agent_perf": {
			"name": "ThousandEyes Agent Performance",
			"options": {
				"query": "| tstats `scd_summariesonly` avg(Test_Metrics.metric_name:network.latency) as latency, avg(Test_Metrics.metric_name:network.loss) as loss, avg(Test_Metrics.metric_name:network.jitter) as jitter, dc(Test_Metrics.thousandeyes.test.name) as tests FROM datamodel=\"Cisco_ThousandEyes.Test_Metrics\" BY Test_Metrics.thousandeyes.source.agent.name | rename Test_Metrics.thousandeyes.source.agent.name as Agent | eval latency=round(latency,1), loss=round(loss,2), jitter=round(jitter,1), Status=case(loss>=5 OR latency>=200, \"Critical\", loss>=1 OR latency>=100, \"Degraded\", 1==1, \"Healthy\") | table Agent tests latency loss jitter Status | rename tests as Tests, latency as \"Latency (ms)\", loss as \"Loss %\", jitter as \"Jitter (ms)\" | sort Agent",
				"queryParameters": {
					"earliest": "$global_time.earliest$",
					"latest": "$global_time.latest$"
				}
			},
			"type": "ds.search"
		},
		"ds_te_agents": {
			"name": "User Experience - ds_te_agents",
			"options": {
				"app": "splunk-cisco-dashboards",
				"queryParameters": {
					"earliest": "$global_time.earliest$",
					"latest": "$global_time.latest$"
				},
				"ref": "User Experience - ds_te_agents",
				"useSavedTimeRange": false
			},
			"type": "ds.savedSearch"
		},
		"ds_te_health": {
			"name": "Executive Dashboard - ds_te_health",
			"options": {
				"app": "splunk-cisco-dashboards",
				"queryParameters": {
					"earliest": "$global_time.earliest$",
					"latest": "$global_time.latest$"
				},
				"ref": "Executive Dashboard - ds_te_health",
				"useSavedTimeRange": false
			},
			"type": "ds.savedSearch"
		},
		"ds_te_health_summary": {
			"name": "ThousandEyes Test Health Summary",
			"options": {
				"extend": "ds_base_te_tests",
				"query": "| stats count by status"
			},
			"type": "ds.chain"
		},
		"ds_top_client_os": {
			"name": "Client OS Distribution",
			"options": {
				"extend": "ds_base_client_ref",
				"query": "| where isnotnull(osType) AND osType!=\"null\" AND osType!=\"\" AND osType!=\"Unknown\" AND osType!=\"unknown\" | stats dc(macAddress) as count by osType | sort -count | head 5 | rename osType as os"
			},
			"type": "ds.chain"
		},
		"ds_top_device_types": {
			"name": "Top Device Types",
			"options": {
				"extend": "ds_base_client_ref",
				"query": "| where isnotnull(deviceType) AND deviceType!=\"null\" AND deviceType!=\"\" AND deviceType!=\"Un-Classified Device\" | stats dc(macAddress) as Clients by deviceType | sort -Clients | head 5 | rename deviceType as \"Device Type\""
			},
			"type": "ds.chain"
		},
		"ds_wired_health": {
			"name": "User Experience - ds_wired_health",
